OL,3,GNEWSAWebsite to help angry residents
OL,4,Afind missing parcels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man frustrated with parcels going
OL,7,Fmissing in his village has created a
OL,8,Fwebsite to help track items and reunite
OL,9,Fthem with their owners.
OL,11,FWes Price, from Itchen Abbas,
OL,12,FHampshire, said he had set up the
OL,13,Fservice after noticing problems with
OL,14,Fdeliveries across the Itchen Valley.
OL,16,FWithin three weeks of launching, he
OL,17,Fsaid 85 parcels had been logged as
OL,18,Fmissing, and of the 79 that had a
OL,19,Fcourier recorded, all but one were
OL,20,Flogged by the user as being sent by
OL,21,FEvri.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
